---
description: Apply for Roblox UI requests - owner screenshots, phone layout, menus, toasts, cards, text size
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

- Building/restyling studded UI: follow `docs/STUDDED_UI_GUIDE.md` (exact values) and clone from the game or `assets/ui/reference/`.
- Fit only, never design: size/position/scale/wrap/Phone* attributes. Not colours, fonts, studs, strokes, art, copy.
- `grep -n "<Name>" ui-map.md` first; regenerate with `python3 tools/uimap/uimap_build.py <place>` after UI builds.
- Fast lane: `tools/rig/go.sh <name> open=<Menu>` → look at `work/rig/out/<name>_pc.png` + `_phone.png` (667x375).
- Avoid thumbstick (bottom-left), jump (bottom-right), menu header/X, notch insets.
- Report shots first; "rig shots only" unless checked in Studio/on a device; name the Studio attribute to edit.
- Windows (PowerShell): `.\tools\rig\go.ps1 <name> open=<Menu>` → same PNGs under `work\rig\out\` (docs/windows.md).
